<p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Amo's six languages all had a job. Pick the one thing you actually want to do in your target language this month - read a news article, argue about a film, write a complaint email - and learn only the vocabulary and structures that task requires. Then do the task in front of someone. That is the disputation, in miniature.</p>
